devcheck_decompiled/

# Aider local session state
.aider.chat.history.md
.aider.input.history
.aider.tags.cache.v4/

# Full device screenshots stay local; only cropped key images are committed
docs/screens/*/raw/

# Product roadmap for the local project tracker; never pushed (repo is public)
/ROADMAP.md
# Inbox of roadmap decisions from chats; applied to ROADMAP.md at session start
/docs/roadmap-inbox.md

# Store listing drafts, store graphics and the UX audit stay local; the repo is public and the audit is private
/docs/store/
/docs/store-graphics/
/docs/audits/

# HQ status file; written at every STOP, never committed
/status.json
